{
	"_about": [
		"The two charts' single-point marks as the running app placed them (nit 5, slice 5c;",
		"docs/proposals/pumps-nits.md item 5, rule 7), captured in Chromium from the one-off and lineups",
		"views (pump-groups-input.json) and the condenser example after Add cases by number running, at",
		"1280x800 (canvas 454 px wide), 390x844 (340 px) and 320x640 (270 px), each with its other",
		"cases' rings on and the pump chart showing Pump PA (one-off), Pump P1 (lineups) or CWP-1",
		"(condenser): web/pump-case-numbers at da7aa98, slice 5b's case numbers (caseTags). x and y",
		"are the centres in CSS px, rounded to 0.1; plot is Chart.js's chartArea. A ring's numbers",
		"and its name as slice 5b labels it (the name on desktop only, and on the group chart only for",
		"a ring whose own curve is not drawn); a pump chart mark not labelled by the placer keeps its",
		"radius and border as drawn. Members, the Group dot and rings take slice 5c's sizes in the test."
	],
